OL,3,GNEWSASamurai sword killer leaves family
OL,4,A'ripped apart'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's been a nightmare, it's ripped my
OL,7,Flife apart," said Craig Hurcombe's
OL,8,Fmother, Nicola. "I was very very close
OL,9,Fto him and I feel like I've lost a big
OL,10,Fpart of myself. I never got to say
OL,11,Fgoodbye, and that's what hurts me more
OL,12,Fthan anything."
OL,14,FCraig, 39, was murdered on New Year's
OL,15,FDay, stabbed with a samurai sword at
OL,16,Fhis work yard as he was preparing his
OL,17,Florry for the following day's job.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
