OL,3,GNEWSASamurai sword killer leaves family
OL,4,A'ripped apart'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis killer, Michael Bretton, 41 from
OL,7,FDorset, was found guilty of murder on
OL,8,F31 July after a trial at Bristol Crown
OL,9,FCourt and sentenced to life in prison
OL,10,Fto serve a minimum term of 29 and a
OL,11,Fhalf years.
OL,13,FA month on from the trial Craig's
OL,14,Ffriends and family say they are still
OL,15,Fstruggling to come to terms with the
OL,16,Fdeath of a man they knew as a devoted
OL,17,Fson, brother and uncle.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
